message: "If you use this software or dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "UCAHub: Understanding Cyber-Aggression through AI Use, Trust, and Personality Factors (UCA)"
abstract: >-
  Study hub and reproducible analysis pipeline for an MSc dissertation
  investigating cyber-aggression in relation to AI use, trust, and
  personality factors. Includes the public study site, R and Python
  analysis scripts, result tables, and an anonymised dataset
  (final analytic sample: 164 responses).
